              "image_path": "raw/pages_0257-0268/images/page_262_image_2.jpg",
              "content": "```mermaid\ngraph TD\n  subgraph Design\n  A[\"设计\"] --> B[\"构建\"]\n  B --> C[\"自组装\"]\n  C --> D[\"质谱和测序\"]\n  D --> E[\"高质量筛选\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Learning\n  F[\"学习\"] --> G[\"机器学习与代谢通量分析\"]\n  G --> H[\"生态位建模\"]\n  H --> I[\"代谢\"]\n  I --> J[\"适宜度\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Construction\n  K[\"设计\"] --> L[\"合成组装\"]\n  L --> M[\"去除反应\\n生态系统优化\"]\n  M --> N[\"调整负载\\n代谢通量\"]\n  N --> O[\"底物\"]\n  O --> P[\"产物\"]\n  end\n```"
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
